<title>USA: Clinton sees no need to raise taxes.</title>
<headline>Clinton sees no need to raise taxes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton said in an interview broadcast on Sunday that he sees no need to raise taxes.</p>
<p>Asked on ABC's &quot;This Week with David Brinkley&quot; programme whether he foresaw any need to raise taxes, Clinton replied: &quot;No.&quot; The interview was taped on Friday.</p>
</text>
